                      "desc": "键名"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [Storage](storage.md) } - 固定源码返回当前 Storage，而不是布尔值 ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [Storage](storage.md) ",
                      "desc": "固定源码返回当前 Storage，而不是布尔值"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "key"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>底层会检查本地存储中是否存在键值 <code>key</code>，但当前 <code>StorageNativeObject</code> 通过链式包装返回当前 Storage 实例，布尔检查结果不会暴露给脚本。不要把返回值当作存在性判断；需要判断时可结合 <code>get(key, sentinel)</code> 使用哨兵值。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let sto = storages.create(&#39;fruit&#39;);\nconst missing = {};\nif (sto.get(&#39;apple&#39;, missing) === missing) {\n    sto.putSync(&#39;apple&#39;, 10);\n}\n</code></pre>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m#] contains"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m#] remove",
          "name": "[m#]_remove",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "remove(key)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "remove",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**key** { [string](data-types.md#string) } - 键名 ",
